artinchip-flash

The protocol and image implementations use ArtInChip's published Luban-Lite
UPG interfaces as references. The Luban-Lite UPG headers and bootloader
sources retain their upstream copyright and license notices.

Binary distributions include a THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt manifest for the
Rust dependency graph and bundled assets. Windows distributions also
include the libusb DLL and its corresponding source archive.
